prompt_template:
Create one complete original character-event poster, aspect ratio {ASPECT_RATIO}. Fusion: jade ground and black street silhouettes from a flat urban newsletter meet scarlet bounded comic panels and cream outlined title/hero from an energetic event poster. The new common device is staggered cut-ended scarlet headline modules, not either reference masthead. STYLE: {STYLE_FIDELITY_ANCHORS}
CHARACTER: {SUBJECT}
SCENE: {SCENE}
COMPOSITION: {DESIGN_DIRECTION} Follow only the plan for the requested ratio.
PRIMARY TITLE, exactly: {MAIN_TEXT}. All letters must remain readable. SECONDARY TEXTURE: {TEXTURE_TEXT}
Keep 20–25% calm flat area, about 30–40% visible graphic design structure, substantial green ground and red panels in every image. Neutral flat cel lighting, no gradients. Fine low-strength ink grain only in some green fields and halftone shadow panels, around 15–25% of total area; clean title and face contours; no paper damage. Five-color palette: jade #26895F, scarlet #D93D3C, cream #F0E3C5, black #101912, ochre #E4AD38 used sparingly.
REPLACE ALL SOURCE CONTENT: {SOURCE_CONTENT_TO_AVOID}
